{"id": 791637, "slug": "wylde-flowers", "name": "Wylde Flowers", "name_original": "Wylde Flowers", "description": "<p>Wylde Flowers is a cozy life and farming sim with a witchy twist! Escape to a cute world of diverse folks, and magical spells, as you and the coven unravel a mystery!</p>\n<p>Play as Tara, as she arrives at a cozy rural island to help out her grandma and the family farm.</p>\n<p>Explore a wholesome world of magical realms, beautiful beaches, secretive forests and the friendly town of Fairhaven.</p>\n<p>Meet a charming cast of fully voice acted characters, with intriguing back stories to reveal. Find friendship or maybe even romance?</p>\n<p>Transform the Wylde family farm into a productive haven bursting with fresh vegetables, fruit trees and cute baby animals!</p>\n<p>Wield your wand and broomstick as you nurture your magical abilities to tend the farm, control the weather, turn the seasons or transform into a cat!</p>\n<p>Create hundreds of recipes for yummy food or artisanal goods to sell. Between fishing, mining, crafting and farming (plus a little magic) you&#39;ll have lots to do.</p>\n<p>Connect with the coven, fall in love and enjoy your cottagecore life as you uncover the mysterious goings-on in the heart of Fairhaven.</p>\n<p>Reveal the hidden darkness which is affecting the town and discover how to bring everyone together.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2022-02-18", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-09-17T09:29:11", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6a0/6a0719b7302a38e3f0b260d1412c955c.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/194/1941f55e21b355b1cbf1d5439ba9f0fc.jpg", "website": "https://wyldeflowersgame.com/", "rating": 3.42, "rating_top": 4, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 5, "percent": 41.67}, {"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 3, "percent": 25.0}, {"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 2, "percent": 16.67}, {"id":