_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/ceb/ceb68aef14fbe54f0610acd8de480f64.jpg"}, {"id": 42410, "name": "LGBTQ+", "slug": "lgbtq-2", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2808, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/9e5/9e5b91a6d02e66b8d450a977a59ae123.jpg"}, {"id": 583, "name": "Narrative", "slug": "narrative", "language": "eng", "games_count": 9146, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/384/3840fdbb91612c81db98176a4c1e7a8d.jpg"}, {"id": 49960, "name": "Life Sim", "slug": "life-sim-2", "language": "eng", "games_count": 3261, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/870/870706c61c19d12dadecde9a1c18f9a8.jpg"}, {"id": 66536, "name": "Романтика", "slug": "romantika", "language": "eng", "games_count": 4572, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/273/2733ce205ad3c4bf257ddea088de1621.jpg"}, {"id": 49969, "name": "Farming Sim", "slug": "farming-sim-2", "language": "eng", "games_count": 1137, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/27b/27bf5aa654c73161e5defc9fa828641d.jpg"}, {"id": 658, "name": "Cozy", "slug": "cozy", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2590, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/496/49664cc0aca1a464a778f0c7d2600c2b.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 60616, "name": "Studio Drydock Pty", "slug": "studio-drydock-pty-ltd", "games_count": 1, "image_background": ""}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "Wylde Flowers is a cozy life and farming sim with a witchy twist! Escape to a cute world of diverse folks, and magical spells, as you and the coven unravel a mystery!\n\n\nPlay as Tara, as she arrives at a cozy rural island to help out her grandma and the family farm.\n\n\nExplore a wholesome world of magical realms, beautiful beaches, secretive forests and the friendly town of Fairhaven.\n\n\nMeet a charming cast of fully voice acted characters, with intriguing back stories to reveal. Find friendship or maybe even romance?\n\n\nTransform the Wylde family farm into a productive haven bursting with fresh vegetables, fruit trees and cute baby animals!\n\n\nWield your wand and broomstick as you nurture your magical abilities to tend the farm, control the weather, turn the seasons or transform into a cat!\n\n\nCreate hundreds of recipes for yummy food or artisanal goods to sell. Between fishing, mining, crafting and farming (plus a little magic) you'll have lots to do.\n\n\nConnect with the coven, fall in love and enjoy your cottagecore life as you uncover the mysterious goings-on in the heart of Fairhaven.\n\n\nReveal the hidden darkness which is affecting the town and discover how to bring everyone together."}